---
import Demo from "./Demo.astro";
---

<section id="audio" class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid reveal">
      <div>
        <h2 class="heading-4 md:heading-2">Record the call. Skip the minutes.</h2>
        <p class="body-3 muted lede">
          Hit record in the sidebar and talk. When you stop, faster-whisper transcribes it on your machine, and your AI provider
          turns the transcript into headings, lists and tasks at the end of the note.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ul class="points body-6 muted">
        <li>Pair it with Ollama or LM Studio and the audio never leaves your computer.</li>
        <li>No provider? You still get the raw transcript.</li>
        <li>Needs Python and FFmpeg. Settings installs everything else.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="clip reveal">
      <Demo
        name="audio"
        alt="A note called Design review. Record audio is pressed in the sidebar and a timer runs in the status bar. After stopping, the status shows Transcribing, then Structuring with Ollama, and a structured section appears in the note: a summary, the decisions as a list, and the action items as a checklist."
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-400);
  }

  .lede {
    margin-top: var(--s-100);
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .points {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-75);
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  .clip {
    margin-top: var(--s-400);
  }

  .points li {
    padding-left: var(--s-200);
    position: relative;
  }

  .points li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 8px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--ember-500);
  }

  @media (min-width: 1000px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 5fr);
      gap: var(--s-700);
      align-items: end;
    }
  }
</style>
